# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Secrets — never commit
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.env
# OBS profiles hold the live Twitch/YouTube stream keys and the obs-websocket
# password. tools/ is excluded wholesale below, but list these explicitly so
# the intent survives any future change to the rules underneath.
tools/obs/config/obs-studio/basic/profiles/*/service.json
tools/obs/config/obs-studio/plugin_config/obs-websocket/config.json

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Third-party binaries. These are downloaded, not written here — OBS portable,
# veadotube, Piper TTS with its voice models, the Claude CLI, a uv-managed
# Python, spirecomm. ~1.8 GB, and none of it is this project's work.
# The exceptions below keep the scripts that ARE.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
tools/*
!tools/*.py
!tools/*.ps1
!tools/balatro-patch/
tools/balatro-patch/*.orig
tools/balatro-patch/*.new
tools/__pycache__/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Runtime output
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
logs/
recordings/
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Avatar artwork — generated character art, kept out of the repo on purpose.
# The expression-switching code and its tests are included; only the images
# are not.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
avatar/
avatar_new/

# Local scratch
*.bak
*.tmp

# Stray folders another program left in here — not part of this project
settings/
ready/
prepare/
lock/
files/

# 포트폴리오 산출물 (자기소개서·발표자료) — 저장소에 올리지 않음
portfolio/
